{"seq":2,"slug":"end-to-end-driving","title":"端到端自动驾驶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms/end-to-end-driving","wordCount":1607,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"端到端自动驾驶\">端到端自动驾驶</h1><p>2024 年 1 月，Tesla 向早期测试用户推送 FSD v12——这是第一个完全端到端的量产自动驾驶系统：从 8 路摄像头的原始像素到方向盘转角和踏板力度，中间不再有任何手写规则。随后的 v13、v14 在这条路线上持续迭代，到 2026 年中 v14.3 已用 MLIR 重写编译器实现 20% 延迟降低，并加入强化学习训练阶段。端到端不再是实验室的论文概念，而是每天服务数百万用户的量产技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模块化管线的根本矛盾在于：<strong>人为设定的模块边界会强制信息压缩</strong>。感知层输出 3D 框和语义标签时，它已经丢弃了纹理、光照、上下文等&quot;看似无关&quot;但对决策有用的信息。经典案例：一个深水坑在感知层不被当作&quot;障碍物&quot;输出，但人类驾驶员会本能避开——这种信息在模块边界处被过滤掉了。</p>\n<p>端到端的核心主张：<strong>让梯度从最终驾驶表现直接反向传播到原始输入，由数据驱动学习整个决策链条中什么信息该保留、什么该丢弃</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"端到端架构三种形态\">端到端架构三种形态</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 纯端到端&#10;        A1[原始传感器] --&gt; B1[单一神经网络] --&gt; C1[控制指令]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 分段可微&#10;        A2[原始传感器] --&gt; B2[共享 Backbone]&#10;        B2 --&gt; C2[感知/预测头]&#10;        B2 --&gt; D2[规划头]&#10;        C2 -.-&gt;|辅助损失| D2&#10;        D2 --&gt; E2[控制指令]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 混合端到端&#10;        A3[原始传感器] --&gt; B3[E2E 主干]&#10;        B3 --&gt; C3[轨迹候选]&#10;        C3 --&gt; D3[安全检验层]&#10;        D3 --&gt; E3[控制指令]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 纯端到端\n        A1[原始传感器] --&gt; B1[单一神经网络] --&gt; C1[控制指令]\n    end\n    subgraph 分段可微\n        A2[原始传感器] --&gt; B2[共享 Backbone]\n        B2 --&gt; C2[感知/预测头]\n        B2 --&gt; D2[规划头]\n        C2 -.-&gt;|辅助损失| D2\n        D2 --&gt; E2[控制指令]\n    end\n    subgraph 混合端到端\n        A3[原始传感器] --&gt; B3[E2E 主干]\n        B3 --&gt; C3[轨迹候选]\n        C3 --&gt; D3[安全检验层]\n        D3 --&gt; E3[控制指令]\n    end</pre><p><strong>纯端到端</strong>（Tesla FSD v12-v14）：传感器原始数据直接映射到控制输出。整个系统是一个巨大的神经网络，训练目标是模仿人类驾驶行为（行为克隆）并通过强化学习超越人类水平。</p>\n<p><strong>分段可微</strong>（UniAD, VAD, GenAD）：保留显式的感知/预测/规划模块划分，但所有模块共享 backbone 并端到端联合训练。辅助任务（检测、预测）提供中间监督信号，帮助训练更稳定。</p>\n<p><strong>混合端到端</strong>（Waymo 部分、Mobileye RSS）：E2E 网络产生轨迹候选，但最终执行前要通过一个独立的安全层进行碰撞检测和规则约束检查。安全层可以是基于规则的，也可以是学习的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模仿学习与行为克隆\">模仿学习与行为克隆</h2><p>端到端驾驶的基础训练范式是<strong>行为克隆（Behavioral Cloning, BC）</strong>：将人类驾驶的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span></span></span></span></span>观测, 动作<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 对作为监督学习的训练数据。</p>\n<p>给定观测序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o_{1:T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和对应的人类动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{1:T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，模型学习策略：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_\\theta(a_t | o_{1:t}) = \\arg\\min_\\theta \\mathbb{E}\\left[\\sum_t \\mathcal{L}(a_t, \\pi_\\theta(o_{1:t}))\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>行为克隆的固有问题是<strong>分布偏移（Distribution Shift）</strong>：模型在训练数据分布内表现良好，但一旦犯一个小错产生偏移，后续输入就进入了训练集从未覆盖的状态空间，导致错误雪崩。</p>\n<p>解决分布偏移的方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DAgger</td>\n<td>用当前策略收集新数据，标注后加入训练集</td>\n<td>早期端到端研究</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轨迹扰动</td>\n<td>在训练时对轨迹加噪声，模拟偏移后的恢复</td>\n<td>Tesla 数据增强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强化学习</td>\n<td>在仿真中探索并获得奖励信号</td>\n<td>FSD v14 RL 阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>世界模型</td>\n<td>用生成模型预测未来，在虚拟环境中纠正</td>\n<td>理想 L4 训练闭环</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"强化学习在端到端中的角色\">强化学习在端到端中的角色</h2><p>2026 年端到端自动驾驶的训练范式已从纯行为克隆进化到 <strong>BC + RL 两阶段训练</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>第一阶段（模仿学习）</strong>：用海量人类驾驶数据做行为克隆预训练，学习基本的驾驶技能</li>\n<li><strong>第二阶段（强化学习）</strong>：在仿真环境（世界模型）中通过奖励信号进一步优化，突破人类水平上限</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Tesla FSD v14.3 的发布说明明确提到&quot;升级了 FSD 神经网络的强化学习训练阶段&quot;，且&quot;通过对困难样本的 RL 训练改善了交通灯处理和小动物避让&quot;。这意味着 RL 不再是论文概念，而是在百万级车队上迭代的工程实践。</p>\n<p>奖励函数设计是 RL 在驾驶中的核心难题：需要平衡安全（不碰撞）、合规（不违章）、效率（不磨蹭）、舒适（不急刹急转）四个维度。实践中通常用多目标加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = w_s \\cdot R_{safety} + w_c \\cdot R_{compliance} + w_e \\cdot R_{efficiency} + w_f \\cdot R_{comfort}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ian</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"世界模型与训练闭环\">世界模型与训练闭环</h2><p>2026 年的另一个重大突破是<strong>世界模型</strong>作为训练闭环的核心基座：</p>\n<p>世界模型本质是一个生成式神经网络，给定当前状态和动作，预测下一时刻的观测。它为 RL 提供了一个可交互的虚拟环境，使模型能在仿真中进行数十亿次探索而不需要真实路测。</p>\n<p>理想汽车率先将训练闭环量产落地：用世界模型生成极端场景（暴雨、事故、施工）→ 模型在虚拟环境中自主探索 → 环境反馈自动优化模型 → 部署到车端验证。这个闭环使迭代速度从月级缩短到周级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vla-视觉-语言-动作模型\">VLA：视觉-语言-动作模型</h2><p>2026 年的前沿方向是将大语言模型的推理能力引入驾驶——<strong>VLA（Vision-Language-Action）模型</strong>。它在视觉感知之上叠加语言理解层，使系统能够：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解自然语言导航指令（&quot;在那个红色建筑前面停下&quot;）</li>\n<li>推理隐含意图（路边有滚动的球 → 可能有儿童即将窜出）</li>\n<li>解释驾驶决策（&quot;因为对向有来车，我选择等待&quot;）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这标志着端到端从&quot;pattern matching&quot;走向&quot;reasoning&quot;——不只是模仿人类动作，而是理解动作背后的因果逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>端到端架构的核心价值是消除模块边界处的信息损耗，让梯度贯穿全链路</li>\n<li>纯 E2E、分段可微、混合 E2E 三种形态对应不同的性能-安全权衡</li>\n<li>行为克隆是基础训练范式，分布偏移是其核心挑战</li>\n<li>BC + RL 两阶段训练已成为 2026 年的量产实践（Tesla FSD v14）</li>\n<li>世界模型将端到端训练从&quot;依赖实采&quot;推向&quot;自主探索&quot;的新范式</li>\n<li>VLA 模型是下一代端到端的探索方向——从模仿到推理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"bev-perception\">BEV 感知与占用网络</a> — 端到端网络中感知 backbone 的具体实现</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/policy-gradient\">强化学习基础中的策略梯度</a> — 端到端 RL 阶段所用的策略优化理论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"端到端自动驾驶","id":"端到端自动驾驶"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"端到端架构三种形态","id":"端到端架构三种形态"},{"level":2,"text":"模仿学习与行为克隆","id":"模仿学习与行为克隆"},{"level":2,"text":"强化学习在端到端中的角色","id":"强化学习在端到端中的角色"},{"level":2,"text":"世界模型与训练闭环","id":"世界模型与训练闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"VLA：视觉-语言-动作模型","id":"vla-视觉-语言-动作模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"BEV 感知与占用网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms/bev-perception"},"next":{"title":"规划与决策算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms/planning-decision"}}